  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">.. ^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">의정부에 있는 경기도과학교육원 북부기초과학교육관에서 올해 매달&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">회씩 선생님들께 도움이 되실 수 있는 주제로 교사 세미나를 시행하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">연수는 아닙니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">북부기초과학교육관 교사연수신청 페이지</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">(&nbsp;</span><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp</span></font></u></a><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;)</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">에서 신청가능하시고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(경기도교사가 아니신 분들은 여기에 댓글을 달고 오심됩니다.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">참가 신청은 이번주 목요일까지 받습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">. 올해 마지막 세미나입니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">관심있는 분들의&nbsp;많은 참여부탁드립니다~</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 34.13px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;\">&lt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 34.13px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;\">전문적학습공동체 활성화를 위한 교사 세미나 실시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 34.13px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; fon