so-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">세미나 주제 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">고등학교 과학과 교육과정 재구성 도전기(지구과학 중심으로)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 23.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">라</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">강사 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">운산고등학교 교사 연현정</span><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
